        <mxCell id="C13odu8RYvGn0Zpt0qUG-241" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Описание микросервисов&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="109" y="2259" width="310" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C13odu8RYvGn0Zpt0qUG-242" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;API Gate &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- точка входа для Web приложения. Маршрутизация запросов от фронтенда к бекенду.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;User Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - сервис работы с пользователем. Т.к. по логике приложения товары и услуги привязаны к пользователю, работа с ними интегрировата в данный сервис.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Auth Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - сервер авторизации, проверяет роли пользователей, выдает токены автроризации.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Auction Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - Сервис работы с аукционами.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Order serice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - Сервис работы с заказами. Хранит данные по заказам конкретных пользователей. Обеспечивает весь жизненый цикл операций по работе с заказами.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Payment Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - Платежный щлюз. Обрабатывает заявки на оплату и взаимодействует с внешними сервисами для приема платежей. Хранит данные о платежах.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Notify Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - Сервис уведомлений. Принимает заявки на отправку уведомлений от микросервисов площадки и осуществляет доставку уведомлений.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Support Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - Работа с обращениями в техническую поддержку.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Dispute Service &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Работа с заявками на опеляцию.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Report Service &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Работа с отчетами. Хранит агрегированные данные необходимые для постороения отчетов.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Search service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - Осуществляет поиск в БД различных микросервисов и выдает результаты поиска во фронтенд. Стейтлес сервис, собственной БД не имеет.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
