        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Dpw9qPdCpb2EvX0i0UXl-5" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;U1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Запрос на создание/редактирование пользователя &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;От портала через API Gate приходят запросы на создание нового пользователя, редактирование профила или получения информации о текущем профиле.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;U2. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Статус/Получения информации профиля&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— В ответ сервис возвращает статус и данные профиля&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1030" y="3146" width="904" height="69" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Dpw9qPdCpb2EvX0i0UXl-6" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Поиск товаров/услуг&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1011" y="2806" width="310" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Dpw9qPdCpb2EvX0i0UXl-7" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;G1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Запрос на создание/редактирования/удаления товаров/услуг&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Клиент на портале через API Gate формирует запрос на создание/редактирование/удаление товаров или услуг&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;G2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Запрос данных о товарах/услугах&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Служба пользователя делает запрос о товарах/услугах у сервиса товаров/услуг&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;. При необходимости создаются/размещаюся новые товары или услуги.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;G3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Данные по товарам/услугам&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;—&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;сервис товаров/услуг возвращает актуальные данные по товарам/услугам или статус выполнения операции на создание/редактирование изменения.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;G4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Статус запроса работы с товарами/услугами&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— сервис пользователя на основе данных от сервиса товаров/услуг производит сохранение соответвующих данных в карточке клиента и отдает порталу статус и актульную информацию по товарам/услугам клиента&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;через API Gate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2000" y="2826" width="904" height="189" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
