        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UtVjApj63TV4J5OI3_k5-9" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Аукцион&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1902" y="3009" width="310" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UtVjApj63TV4J5OI3_k5-10" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Au1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Запрос на выполнение команды работы с аукционом&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Клиент или Администратор на портале через API Gate формирует запросы на создание/редактирование аукциона, обработки заявок на укцион, обновление ставок и статуса аукциона. Сервис Аукциона обрабатывает запросы, производит действия согласно бизнес логики, взаимодействует с другими микросервисами необходимыми для работы аукциона.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Au2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Результат выполнения запроса&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Клиент портала или&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Администратор&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;через API Gate получает результат обработки запроса сервисом Аукционов&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Au3. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Резервирование товаров/услуг&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Когда кто то из клиентов выйгрывает аукцион сервис аукционов отправляет запрос сервису товаров/услуг на резервирование необходимого товара/услуги&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Au4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Запрос на оплату товара/услуги&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— сервис аукционов отправляет запрос на оплату заказа. При этом цена рассчитывается исходя из цены товара/услуги поставщика, выйгравшего аукцион.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(14, 14, 14); font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Au5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(14, 14, 14); text-indent: -21px;&quot;&gt;Подтверждение оплаты на оплаты&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— когда оплата произведена сервис оплаты отпраляет подтверждение сервису ацкионов.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(14, 14, 14); font-size: 15px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Au6. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(14, 14, 14); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Списание товара/услуги&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(14, 14, 14); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;— сПосле подтверждения оплаты сервис аукциона отправляет сервису товаров/услуг запрос на списание соответвующего товара/услуги у нужного поставщика.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22Au3%22%20style%3D%22ellipse%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Baspect%3Dfixed%3Brounded%3D1%3BfillColor%3D%23FF77BF%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%222212%22%20y%3D%22823%22%20width%3D%2223%22%20height%3D%2223%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(14, 14, 14); text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Au7.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(14, 14, 14); text-indent: -21px;&quot;&gt;Завершение заказа&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(14, 14, 14); text-indent: -21px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-indent: -21px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— сервис аукционов отправляет запрос на выполнение заказа сервису заказов.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(14, 14, 14); text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Au8.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(14, 14, 14); text-indent: -21px;&quot;&gt;Подтверждение о закрытии заказа&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(14, 14, 14); text-indent: -21px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— сервис заказов отпвляет сервису аукционов статус операции п завешении заказа. Аукцион по данному заказу может быть завершен.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22Au3%22%20style%3D%22ellipse%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Baspect%3Dfixed%3Brounded%3D1%3BfillColor%3D%23FF77BF%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%222212%22%20y%3D%22823%22%20width%3D%2223%22%20height%3D%2223%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
